Example trust-policy.json

JSON

```
{
  "Version":"2012-10-17",
  "Statement": [
    {
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Principal": {
        "Service": "lambda.amazonaws.com"
      },
      "Action": "sts:AssumeRole"
    }
  ]
}
```

```
aws iam create-role \
  --role-name lambda-ex \
  --assume-role-policy-document file://trust-policy.json
```

To add permissions to the role, use the attach-policy-to-role command.

